    <mz:justification>The tool also maps to OSCAL inventory-item (the catalog's exchange form), SPDX 3's software Package and CycloneDX's component (the inventory's), each to be exported by 0023-if-workspaces FR-040; their IRIs are to verify</mz:justification>
