  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifws-ToolCatalog">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifws:ToolCatalog</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0023-if-workspaces FR-037</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Catalog</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ToolCatalog</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifws-Workspace">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifws:Workspace</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:decision rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/decision-ifws-Workspace"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0023-if-workspaces FR-001</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>No standard adopted yet. Examined: PROV-O (prov:Entity is too general to carry a root, a layout and a policy), DOAP (describes a project and its repositories, not a local area they are cloned into), the Development Containers specification (workspaceFolder is a setting of a configuration file, not a vocabulary) and the VS Code workspace file (a product format). None defines a managed local workspace. Kept unaligned by the owner's decision of 2026-11-17 (issue #10); reviewed again by 2027-02-15.</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifws-WorkspacePolicy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifws:WorkspacePolicy</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Maps"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0023-if-workspaces FR-032</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>ODRL's Policy is a set of permissions, prohibitions and duties; the workspace policy also carries a severity and a grace period for each rule, so it is a close match and not a subclass</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>closeMatch</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Policy</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifws-WorkspaceState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifws:WorkspaceState</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0023-if-workspaces FR-022</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspaceState</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifws-Worktree">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifws:Worktree</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Maps"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0023-if-workspaces FR-007</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>Git defines the term in its manual and publishes no RDF vocabulary, so the mapping names the manual page of git-worktree</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>closeMatch</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>https://git-scm.com/docs/git-worktree</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Worktree</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Action">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Action</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/Action"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One step of a plan: its kind, what it acts on and, for a skip or a refusal, why.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Action kind</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Clone, fast-forward, create a worktree, configure a repository, write or remove a generated file, install a tool, skip or refuse.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Ahead">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ahead</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The branch has commits its remote does not.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Behind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">behind</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The remote has commits the branch does not, and the branch has none of its own.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#FastForward"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#BuiltIn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">built-in</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A typed module the command holds.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:precedence rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</ifws:precedence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ChangeRequests">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">change requests</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A pull request (GitHub) or a merge request (GitLab), behind the interface.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Clean">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">clean</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The branch equals its remote and the working tree has no change.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Clone">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">clone</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Clone a repository that is missing.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#CloneUrl">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">clone URL</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The URL a repository is cloned from, for a path of the workspace and the reverse.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ConfigureHost">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">configure host</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Change the host outside the workspace: the Windows long-path setting, the global Git include or the shell snippet; only `ifws setup` may do it.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ConfigureRepo">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">configure repository</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Set a repository's local Git configuration: its hooks path, signing and, on Windows, long paths.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#CreateWorktree">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">create worktree</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Add a worktree of a repository for a branch.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Credentials">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">credentials</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Authentication through a Git credential helper, the host's command-line tool or a token from the environment, never a secret stored in a file.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#DefaultBranch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">default branch</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The name of the branch the remote presents as its default.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Detached">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">detached</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">HEAD is on no branch.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Dirty">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">dirty</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The working tree has uncommitted or untracked changes.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Diverged">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">diverged</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Both the branch and its remote have commits the other lacks.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Environment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">environment</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The host cannot run it: a missing tool, an unwritable or absent home, an unsupported runtime.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:exitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</ifws:exitCode>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Error">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">error</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Wrong now; a run that has one exits with findings and a plan does not act on what it names.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:sarifLevel>error</ifws:sarifLevel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exit status</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What a run exits with: 0 ok, 1 findings, 2 usage, 3 environment.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#FastForward">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">fast-forward</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Move a branch that is behind its remote forward, with no merge, rebase or reset.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Finding</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What a check reports: the rule, a severity, what it is about and the day it was first seen; it is written as a SARIF result.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Findings">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">findings</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The run ended and has at least one warning or error.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:exitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</ifws:exitCode>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Generated file</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A file a typed template makes inside the workspace, named `.auto.`, with a header that names its generator, never edited by hand.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Git">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">plain Git</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any other Git remote: what Git itself offers and nothing a host adds.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#CloneUrl"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Credentials"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#DefaultBranch"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#SignedCommits"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Git capability</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One thing a Git manager may offer through the interface.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManager">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Git manager</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The one interface to a Git host: its clone URL, credentials, default branch, protected branches, issues, change requests and signed commits, with `unsupported` where a host lacks one.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Git manager kind</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">GitHub, GitLab or plain Git, with the capabilities each supports.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Github">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">GitHub</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">GitHub, public and private repositories: an owner and a repository.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ChangeRequests"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#CloneUrl"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Credentials"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#DefaultBranch"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Issues"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ProtectedBranches"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#SignedCommits"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Gitlab">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">GitLab</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">GitLab, public and private repositories, in groups to any depth.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ChangeRequests"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#CloneUrl"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Credentials"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#DefaultBranch"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Issues"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#NestedGroups"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ProtectedBranches"/>
    <ifws:supports rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#SignedCommits"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Informational">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">informational</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">To be known, never failing a run.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:sarifLevel>note</ifws:sarifLevel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#InstallTool">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">install tool</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Install a pinned artifact of the tool catalog into the workspace's tool store; only `ifws setup` may do it.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Issues">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">issues</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Issues of the repository, behind the interface.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Locked">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">locked</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Git lock file is present: another process may be working in the repository.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Missing">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">missing</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Nothing is at the repository's path.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Clone"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Module">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Module</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/SoftwareApplication"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A part of the command, `ifws-&lt;name&gt;`: built in, registered by the workspace or an executable on the path.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Module source</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Built-in, registered or on the path, in the order a module is looked for.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#NestedGroups">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">nested groups</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Groups to any depth between the host and the repository (GitLab); a host without them has one owner level.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#NotARepo">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">not a repository</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Something other than a Git repository is at the path.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Refuse"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Ok">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ok</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The run did what was asked and has no warning or error.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:exitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</ifws:exitCode>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Path">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">on the path</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An executable named `ifws-*` on the `PATH`, like Git's `git-foo`.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:precedence rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</ifws:precedence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Plan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Plan</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The actions that would bring the workspace from its observed state to the one its manifest states; making it changes nothing.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ProtectedBranches">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">protected branches</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether a branch can be asked about as protected: no push, no force, review required.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Refuse">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">refuse</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Do nothing because doing it would not be safe, and say why.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Registered">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">registered</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A module the workspace names in `modules.auto.json`.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:precedence rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</ifws:precedence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RemoveGenerated">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">remove generated file</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Remove a generated file that the state record holds and nobody edited.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Repository observation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The state of one repository at a time: its state, how many commits it is ahead or behind and how many stashes it holds.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Repository state</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Missing, clean, dirty, ahead, behind, diverged, locked, detached, on the wrong remote or not a repository.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Repository</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Git repository cloned into the workspace at the path that mirrors its remote URL.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Setup">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Setup</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The one run that may install a pinned tool or change the host: its plan, and whether it was applied or only shown.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Severity</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Informational, warning or error, each with the SARIF level it is written as.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#SignedCommits">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">signed commits</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether a commit's signature, OpenPGP or SSH, can be seen as verified.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Skip">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">skip</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Do nothing, and say why.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#StateRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">State record</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The record of what the last run wrote: the hash of each generated file, the last plan and the day each unapproved tool or module was first seen.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tool</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/SoftwareApplication"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A program the workspace may use: its name, version and, for one operating system and architecture, the artifact's URL and SHA-256.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ToolCatalog">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tool catalog</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Catalog"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The tools a workspace approves, each pinned to a version and a hash; a tool outside it is a finding.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Usage">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">usage</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The command line is wrong: an unknown command, option or argument.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:exitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</ifws:exitCode>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Warning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">warning</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">To be fixed; a run that has one exits with findings.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:sarifLevel>warning</ifws:sarifLevel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Workspace</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The one root folder of Intellectual Frontiers Workspaces: the repositories, worktrees, tools, policy and generated files under it, and nothing outside it.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Workspace policy</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What the workspace requires: signed commits, the regulated domain it claims, the days an unapproved tool or module is only informational and the Git hosts it allows.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspaceState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Workspace state</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What was observed of the workspace on one day: the observation of each of its repositories.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Worktree">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Worktree</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Git worktree of a repository, made for one branch when another person or agent, or uncommitted work, is on the repository.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WriteGenerated">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">write generated file</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Write a generated file inside the workspace.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:destructive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:destructive>
    <ifws:hostChange rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:hostChange>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WrongRemote">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wrong remote</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The repository at the path has a remote other than the one the manifest names.</skos:definition>
    <ifws:defaultAction rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Refuse"/>
    <ifws:fastForwardable rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</ifws:fastForwardable>
    <ifws:holdsLocalWork rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ifws:holdsLocalWork>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#actionKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Action"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">action kind</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The kind of action.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#actionReason">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Action"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">action reason</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Why a step is skipped or refused.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#actionTarget">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Action"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">action target</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What the action acts on: a path under the root, or a tool's name and version.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#aheadBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ahead by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The commits the branch has that its remote does not.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#allowedGitHost">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">allowed git host</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Git host a repository may be cloned from; with none, any.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#applied">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Setup"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">applied</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the setup changed anything; false for a dry run, which is the default.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#behindBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">behind by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The commits the remote has that the branch does not.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#branchSlug">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Worktree"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">branch slug</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The branch's name made into one portable path segment: the last segment of the worktree's path.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#catalogs">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ToolCatalog"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">catalogs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A tool the catalog approves.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#contentSha256">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">content sha256</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SHA-256 of the bytes written, in lower-case hexadecimal.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#defaultAction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">default action</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The kind of action a plan holds for a repository in this state, before a policy changes it.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#defaultBranch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">default branch</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The branch the remote presents as its default.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#destructive">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">destructive</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the kind removes what exists: it runs only when asked for, and a dry run shows it first.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#exitCode">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ExitStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">exit code</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The number the process exits with.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#fastForwardable">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">fast forwardable</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether a plan may hold a fast-forward of a repository in this state: only where the branch is behind and holds nothing of its own.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#fileMode">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">file mode</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The mode the file is written with: 0644 or, for a script, 0755.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#firstSeenOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">first seen on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day (YYYY-MM-DD) the finding was first seen, from which an informational finding turns into a warning.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#generatedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">generated by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The template that made it, by name.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#generatedPath">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">generated path</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The file's path under the root, `/`-separated, with `.auto.` in its name.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#gitHost">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">git host</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The name of the Git host, in lower case, the first segment of the repository's path.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#governedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">governed by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The policy the workspace is held to.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#hasAction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Plan"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has action</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Action"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A step of the plan, in order.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#hasObservation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspaceState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has observation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The observation of one repository.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#hasRepository">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has repository</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A repository of the workspace.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#holdsLocalWork">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">holds local work</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the folder may hold work that exists nowhere else, so that nothing may remove it; true wherever it is not known to be clean.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#hostChange">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ActionKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">host change</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the kind changes the host outside the workspace's own files: only `ifws setup` may carry it out.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#inState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">in state</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The state the repository was in.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#installs">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Setup"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">installs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A tool the setup installed.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#lastPlan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#StateRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">last plan</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Plan"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The plan of the last run that wrote.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#managedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">managed by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManager"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Git manager that serves the repository's host.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#managerHost">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManager"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">manager host</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The host name the manager serves, `github.com` or a host a manifest names.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#managerKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManager"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">manager kind</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">GitHub, GitLab or plain Git.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#message">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">message</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One sentence saying what is wrong and what to do.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#moduleName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Module"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">module name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The module's name, the part after `ifws-`: lower-case letters, digits and hyphens.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#moduleSource">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Module"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">module source</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Where the module was found.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#moduleSummary">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Module"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">module summary</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One line saying what the module does.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#observationOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">observation of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The repository observed.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#observedAt">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspaceState"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">observed at</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day (YYYY-MM-DD) of the observation.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#plannedFor">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Plan"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">planned for</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The workspace the plan is for.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#precedence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ModuleSource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">precedence</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The order the source is looked in: the lowest first.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#provides">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">provides</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A command or a capability the tool provides.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#recordsFile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#StateRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">records file</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GeneratedFile"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generated file the record holds the hash of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#regulatedDomain">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">regulated domain</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A regulated domain the workspace claims, such as the one of the FDA's QMSR.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#remoteUrl">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">remote url</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The URL the repository is cloned from.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#repoPath">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">repo path</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The repository's path under the root, `/`-separated: the Git host, the path of the remote and the repository.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#requiresSignedCommits">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">requires signed commits</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether a commit that is not signed and verified is an error; true for a regulated domain.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ruleId">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">rule id</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The identifier of the rule that found it, `ifws/` and a name: the SARIF `ruleId`.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#sarifLevel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sarif level</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SARIF `level` the severity is written as: note, warning or error.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#setupPlan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Setup"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">setup plan</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Plan"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The plan the setup showed, and carried out where it was applied.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#severity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">severity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Severity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How serious the finding is.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#stashCount">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoObservation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">stash count</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The entries of the repository's stash.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#subject">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Finding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">subject</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What the finding is about: a path under the root, a tool or a module.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#supports">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitManagerKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">supports</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#GitCapability"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A capability the kind of Git manager supports; one it does not list is unsupported.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolArch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool arch</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The processor architecture the artifact is for: x64 or arm64.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The tool's name.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolOs">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool os</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The operating system the artifact is for: linux, macos or windows.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolSha256">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool sha256</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SHA-256 of the artifact, in lower-case hexadecimal.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolUrl">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool url</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The `https` URL the artifact is fetched from.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#toolVersion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Tool"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tool version</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The one version pinned, never `latest` and never a range.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#unapprovedGraceDays">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#WorkspacePolicy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">unapproved grace days</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The days a tool or module outside the catalog is informational, counted from the day it was first seen; 90 unless the policy lowers it.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#usesCatalog">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uses catalog</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#ToolCatalog"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The catalog of tools the workspace approves.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#workspaceHome">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">workspace home</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The workspace's root folder, as `$IFC_WORKSPACES_HOME` or `--home` gives it.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#worktreeOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Worktree"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">worktree of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Repository"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The repository the worktree is of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">The vocabulary of Intellectual Frontiers Workspaces: the workspace and its repositories, Git managers, tools, policy, plans, findings, generated files and modules.</dcterms:description>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Intellectual Frontiers Workspaces</rdfs:label>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws/1.0.0"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
